[h2]Travel reliability overhaul + the Toxeus bosses and their souls[/h2]

[b]Travel[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Fixed the scrambled teleports.[/b] Talking to a traveler could send you to the wrong place, or leave a traveler silent, once you had moved around the world a while. The whole travel system was rebuilt to the base-game pattern so a traveler goes where its label says. Almyros in the Village of Helos remains your hub to the Garden of Merchants, the Secret Place, and the Uber Dungeon.
[*][b]A way into the Uber Dungeon from the Labyrinth.[/b] After the Minotaur, further along the passage past his door, a traveler will take you down into the dungeon.
[*][b]The Warden of the Spartan Crypt[/b] in the Athens catacombs was reworked toward letting you descend into the crypt.
[/list]

[b]Toxeus the Murderer[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Akremon[/b], the Golden Bough uber, is back to a proper imposing size and strength with a signature kit.
[*][b]The Endless Hunt[/b] is a skeleton again, as his kin are, and fights with his own moves.
[*][b]Lethaeus the Unremembered[/b] second form is now the escalation it should be, not a weaker one.
[*][b]The soul tiers now matter.[/b] The Epic and Legendary versions of the Toxeus souls summon markedly stronger versions, and grant +1 / +2 / +3 to all skills on Normal / Epic / Legendary.
[*][b]The forge formula[/b] that crafts the ultimate Toxeus soul is easier to spot when it drops.
[/list]

[b]Loot[/b]
[list]
[*]The uber boss stash chests were restored toward their original Soulvizier generosity after being trimmed too far.
[*]Toxeus the Murderer, the Devourer of Blood now guards his stash on every difficulty.
[/list]

[i]Credits: [b]amgoz1[/b] for Soulvizier and the emblem, used with permission - [b]soa[/b] for Soulvizier AERA - [b]Dragonlord[/b] for DRX.[/i]
